#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1048
msgid "The third panel of the <interface>Text Import</interface> Druid"
msgstr "Tredje panelen i guiden <interface>Textimport</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1053
msgid ""
"This panel allows users to select and format the columns to be imported to "
"the <application>Gnumeric</application> workbook. The first button allows "
"the exclusion of empty columns on either of the outer sides of the columns "
"with data. The second button allows the user to define the locale used to "
"interpret the values in the file. The remaining area allows the user to "
"predefine the data format to be used for all the values in each column. This"
" area also allows the users to select which columns in the file will be "
"imported to the <application>Gnumeric</application> worksheet. Finally, this"
" panel provides the <guibutton>Finish</guibutton> which is used to dismiss "
"the dialog and import the file."
msgstr ""
"Här väljer och formaterar du kolumnerna som ska importeras till en arbetsbok"
" i <application>Gnumeric</application>. Den första knappen låter dig ta bort"
" tomma kolumner vid kanterna. Med den andra väljer du vilka regionala "
"inställningar som ska användas när filens värden tolkas. I resten av panelen"
" anger du dataformat för varje kolumn och väljer vilka kolumner som ska "
"importeras till kalkylbladet i <application>Gnumeric</application>. Klicka "
"till sist på <guibutton>Slutför</guibutton> för att stänga dialogrutan och "
"importera filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1068
msgid ""
"The third panel of the <interface>Text Import</interface> druid with the "
"component areas labeled with callouts."
msgstr ""
"Den tredje panelen i guiden <interface>Textimport</interface>, med delarna "
"märkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1079
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the third panel 'Text Import' druid with callouts "
"labeling the different areas."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbilden visar den tredje panelen i textimportguiden med de olika "
"områdena märkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1085
msgid ""
"The different components of the third panel of the <interface>Text "
"Import</interface> druid with each component labeled with a callout."
msgstr ""
"De olika delarna i den tredje panelen i guiden "
"<interface>Textimport</interface>, alla märkta."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1101
msgid "The components of the third panel"
msgstr "Delarna i den tredje panelen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1104
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> - The trim of empty outer columns drop "
"down list button."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> – Rullgardinsmeny för tomma "
"kantkolumner."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1109
msgid ""
"This button provides a list allowing the user to select whether to trim any "
"outer columns which are completely empty. The choices are to delete the "
"columns on both sides, on neither side, or on one side only. This will only "
"affect columns which have been previously defined but which contain no data "
"values at all."
msgstr ""
"Med knappen väljer du om helt tomma ytterkolumner ska tas bort: på båda "
"sidor, på ingen sida eller bara på ena sidan. Det gäller bara kolumner som "
"redan har definierats men saknar värden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1122
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> - Locale definition for import drop "
"down menu button."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> – Rullgardinsmeny för regionala "
"inställningar vid import."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1127
msgid ""
"This button provides a list of locales which can be set. The chosen locale "
"will affect how numeric values are interpreted when then are imported. For "
"instance, the locale will define the character expected as the decimal "
"separator which is the period character (.) in some locales, and the comma "
"character (,) in others. These locales generally then use the other "
"character as the spacer grouping the digits in thousands."
msgstr ""
"Menyn visar de regionala inställningar som du kan välja mellan. Valet "
"påverkar hur numeriska värden tolkas vid import. Inställningarna avgör till "
"exempel vilket tecken som används som decimaltecken: punkt (.) i vissa "
"regioner och komma (,) i andra. Då används vanligtvis det andra tecknet som "
"tusentalsavgränsare."
